{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"title":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerforpushnotificationswithcompletion:"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Registers the device for push notifications with a completion handler.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSString#*$objc(cs)NSError)","text":"void (^)(NSString *, NSError *)","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Block called when registration completes, providing the push token or an error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Token is nil if registration failed or user denied permission."}]}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method combines system permission request with Pushwoosh server registration.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The completion handler provides feedback on both operations, allowing you to:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update UI based on registration status","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Track registration analytics"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle errors gracefully with retry logic"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync push token with your backend server"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Handle registration in onboarding flow with analytics tracking:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class OnboardingViewController: UIViewController {","","    func enableNotificationsTapped() {","        showLoadingState()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications { [weak self] token, error in","            DispatchQueue.main.async {","                self?.hideLoadingState()","","                if let error = error {","                    Analytics.track(\"push_registration_failed\", properties: [","                        \"error\": error.localizedDescription","                    ])","                    self?.showRetryOption()","                    return","                }","","                if let token = token {","                    Analytics.track(\"push_registration_success\")","                    self?.syncTokenWithBackend(token)","                    self?.proceedToNextStep()","                } else {","                    Analytics.track(\"push_permission_denied\")","                    self?.showPermissionDeniedInfo()","                }","            }","        }","    }","","    private func syncTokenWithBackend(_ token: String) {","        APIClient.shared.updatePushToken(token) { result in","            if case .failure(let error) = result {","                Logger.error(\"Backend sync failed: \\(error)\")","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers the device for push notifications with a completion handler."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerforpushnotificationswithcompletion:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifi